71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (The API-Based COVID/Health Stats Tracker is a web application developed using React that provides real-time COVID-19 and health-related statistics from a public API. The application helps health awareness organizations monitor and display important health information for different countries. Users can search for a country and view live statistics such as total cases, active cases, recovered cases, deaths, and recovery rates. The system also provides conditional alerts for high-risk countries based on predefined thresholds. The project demonstrates the use of React components, API integration, state management, and dynamic data rendering to create an informative and user-friendly dashboard.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
